FROM golang:1.26-alpine AS build
WORKDIR /src
# external/ must precede go mod download: go.mod has filesystem
# replace directives (./external/gossip-system, ./external/grpc-service)
# and download fails when the targets are absent.
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
COPY external/ ./external/
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
ARG VERSION=dev
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags "-s -w -X main.version=$VERSION" -o /beacon-agent ./cmd/beacon-agent

FROM alpine:3.24
RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates tini wget && adduser -D -u 10001 beacon
COPY --from=build /beacon-agent /usr/local/bin/beacon-agent
USER beacon
VOLUME ["/data"]
HEALTHCHECK --interval=10s --timeout=3s --retries=3 CMD wget -q --spider http://localhost:8501/health
ENTRYPOINT ["/sbin/tini", "--", "beacon-agent"]
CMD ["-server=http://server-1:8500", "-data-dir=/data"]
